    "text": "The sum, <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><munderover><mo stretchy=\"true\">&#8721;</mo><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mn>7</mn></munderover><mfrac><mrow><mi>n</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>n</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced></mrow><mn>4</mn></mfrac></math>, is equal to"
