  "solution": {
    "text": "<p>Given,</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><munderover><mo stretchy=\"true\">&#8721;</mo><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mn>7</mn></munderover><mfrac><mrow><mi>n</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>n</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced></mrow><mn>4</mn></mfrac></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>4</mn></mfrac><mfenced open=\"[\" close=\"]\" separators=\"|\"><mrow><munderover><mo>&#8721;</mo><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mn>7</mn></munderover><mn>2</mn><msup><mi>n</mi><mn>3</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>3</mn><msup><mi>n</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mi>n</mi></mrow></mfenced></math></p><p>Now using&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><munderover><mo>&#8721;</mo><mrow/><mrow/></munderover><mfenced><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>+</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>+</mo><mi>n</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>n</mi><mfenced><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced></mrow><mn>2</mn></mfrac></math>,&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><munderover><mo>&#8721;</mo><mrow/><mrow/></munderover><mfenced><mrow><msup><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mn>2</mn><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mn>3</mn><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>n</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>n</mi><mfenced><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced><mfenced><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>n</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced></mrow><mn>6</mn></mfrac></math>&nbsp;and&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><munderover><mo>&#8721;</mo><mrow/><mrow/></munderover><mfenced><mrow><msup><mn>1</mn><mn>3</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mn>2</mn><mn>3</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mn>3</mn><mn>3</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>n</mi><mn>3</mn></msup></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><msup><mfenced open=\"[\" close=\"]\"><mfrac><mrow><mi>n</mi><mfenced><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced></mrow><mn>2</mn></mfrac></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msup></math>, we can write<br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>4</mn></mfrac><mfenced open=\"[\" close=\"]\" separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>2</mn><msup><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mfrac><mrow><mn>7</mn><mo>&#183;</mo><mn>8</mn></mrow><mn>2</mn></mfrac></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>3</mn><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mfrac><mrow><mn>7</mn><mo>&#183;</mo><mn>8</mn><mo>&#183;</mo><mn>15</mn></mrow><mn>6</mn></mfrac></mfenced><mo>+</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>7</mn><mo>&#183;</mo><mn>8</mn></mrow><mn>2</mn></mfrac></mrow></mfenced></math><br /><math><mfrac><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>4</mn></mrow></mfrac><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\" separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><mn>49</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><mn>16</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>28</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><mn>15</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>28</mn></mrow></mfenced></math><br /><math><mfrac><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>4</mn></mrow></mfrac><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\" separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>1568</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>420</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>28</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mo>=</mo><mn>504</mn></math>.</p>"
